{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"有片｜人形機械人KPOP勁歌熱舞迎APEC　大跳BIGBANG舞蹈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-18-10-47-51vBvJjTeh.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】為迎接APEC會議在深圳盛大舉行，位於龍崗區坂田街道星河WORLD的中國首個具身智慧機械人示範街區，近日有151部人形機械以南韓天團BIGBANG的歌曲等作背景音樂，展示了內地人形機械人的創新實力與研發成果。此外，今次151部人形機械人於一小時內在街頭同步跳舞的場景，同時刷新了健力士紀錄。</p><p>資料及影片來源：互聯網、小紅書</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:24:56.917829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:41.491664+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T03:18:25.942863+00:00","content_hash":"7b10f36b131a1963fc7735cea8ea970a965c287154d5f12aca2287ccccf71db3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}